   [#D7D7AF]sized whole-item, chain, and link closes plus their teaching errors in [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the execution and editor parsers, extend `capture-parse` spans/JSON and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the close-outcome aliases, and make `bob capture` refuse sized specs [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]until execution lands.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Run sized closes with exact-or-refuse[/bold #D7AFFF]                         [bold white on #D75F87] large  [/bold white on #D75F87]\n    [#AF87FF]execute[dim] · [dim][/dim]after grammar[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]execute: stage exactly 5N minutes from the session start, close at C = [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]min(S + 5N, now) through all three close entry points, refuse with coded[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]two-line errors, add `pomodoro_close.size` JSON, the sized human caption[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]and `tip:`, and bump the grammar revision to 20.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Document `Nx` and record the decision[/bold #D7AFFF]                         [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]docs[dim] · [dim][/dim]after execute[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]docs: update capture.md, the capture-syntax reference, and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]capture/capture-parse help, regenerate CLI docs, and add the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]exact-or-refuse decision record when its decision is on.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Present sized closes in Bob Mac Capture[/bold #D7AFFF]                       [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]mac[dim] · [dim][/dim]after execute[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]mac: decode `size`, draw both-direction arrows and the `Nx · as of [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]HH:MM` chip, widen the close-alias prefilter for digit prefixes, record [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]fixtures from a real bob, and watch macOS CI to green.[/#D7D7AF]",